{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>屯門發生燒炭事件。今日（18日）下午2時39分，警方接獲報案，指山景邨景榮樓一單位內，有一男一女懷疑燒炭尋短。</p><p>救援人員接報到場，發現兩人陷入昏迷，雙雙由救護車送往屯門醫院搶救。兩人隨後由醫生證實身亡。</p><p>據了解，兩人均年約七旬。警方正調查兩人關係、及事件起因。就現場所見，大批警員帶備裝備、與便衣警員先後登樓調查；多輛警車停泊在大廈對開。據悉，警方初步以「自殺協定」方向調查。</p><figure><img alt=\"多名便裝警員登樓調查。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261018/1188531223027257344459638.jpeg/ynIUMTjeSXM4N-jw8tMwTM2dvvRErXPbPMkioBnJIqA\"/><figcaption>多名便裝警員登樓調查。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大批警員趕到山景邨調查事件。(王譯揚攝)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261018/1188517218665762816564130.jpeg/18r_XN3XZk-7gqL_IAytIf6hd-fxEDAgE6blRzam5Uc\"/><figcaption>大批警員趕到山景邨調查事件。(王譯揚攝)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大批警員趕到山景邨調查事件。(王譯揚攝)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261018/1188517215347937280718239.jpeg/ruKTy6saTBYOvoS5N06UWx1ISbRy8Qa1HjE-xjsxPsY\"/><figcaption>大批警員趕到山景邨調查事件。(王譯揚攝)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"屯門山景邨兩人燒炭，雙雙由救護車送院搶救。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186262531635679232321875.jpeg/JNTwJMP0IHBhIMy4-eCh2GbJpVJItzWyoxkHLaMZBy0\"/><figcaption>屯門山景邨兩人燒炭，雙雙由救護車送院搶救。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場為屯門山景邨。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250308/975051033455628288964527.jpeg/x9NCSFsXDHqDXtBFGDOU83oDlM75OTJ6m5t3Cpubdwo\"/><figcaption>現場為屯門山景邨。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大批警員趕到山景邨調查事件。(王譯揚攝)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261018/1188517218665762816564130.jpeg/18r_XN3XZk-7gqL_IAytIf6hd-fxEDAgE6blRzam5Uc\"/><figcaption>大批警員趕到山景邨調查事件。(王譯揚攝)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大批警員趕到山景邨調查事件。(王譯揚攝)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261018/1188517215347937280718239.jpeg/ruKTy6saTBYOvoS5N06UWx1ISbRy8Qa1HjE-xjsxPsY\"/><figcaption>大批警員趕到山景邨調查事件。(王譯揚攝)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大批警員趕到山景邨調查事件。(王譯揚攝)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261018/1188518723388968960328069.jpeg/uKb5EQZnMpQL9hrpdgUGPxdXTgKUBvPMo3bO04Z2ztM\"/><figcaption>大批警員趕到山景邨調查事件。(王譯揚攝)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大批警員趕到山景邨調查事件。(王譯揚攝)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261018/1188517218665762816564130.jpeg/18r_XN3XZk-7gqL_IAytIf6hd-fxEDAgE6blRzam5Uc\"/><figcaption>大批警員趕到山景邨調查事件。(王譯揚攝)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大批警員趕到山景邨調查事件。(王譯揚攝)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261018/1188517215347937280718239.jpeg/ruKTy6saTBYOvoS5N06UWx1ISbRy8Qa1HjE-xjsxPsY\"/><figcaption>大批警員趕到山景邨調查事件。(王譯揚攝)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"屯門山景邨兩人燒炭，雙雙由救護車送院搶救。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186262531635679232321875.jpeg/JNTwJMP0IHBhIMy4-eCh2GbJpVJItzWyoxkHLaMZBy0\"/><figcaption>屯門山景邨兩人燒炭，雙雙由救護車送院搶救。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場為屯門山景邨。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250308/975051033455628288964527.jpeg/x9NCSFsXDHqDXtBFGDOU83oDlM75OTJ6m5t3Cpubdwo\"/><figcaption>現場為屯門山景邨。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T09:39:04.358895+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":435,"images":12,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T07:27:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T10:37:44.491334+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T09:37:41.743101+00:00","content_hash":"bfe1121ba376b73cc9bab619ba0ec4b8e55a80086cdbc2312c3e47f97ab96570","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}